    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900760/extras/efe893b45e39f394294f90386c04e22e.avif?t=1712930572\" width=600 height=238 /></span><br>SokoPenguin is a Sokoban-style puzzle game, where you control a penguin who must push boxes to clear the path to its cozy igloo. With each level, the puzzles become more complex, and new mechanics are introduced.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900760/extras/5ed43888c1d14e189e77c3eb22bb0107.poster.avif?t=1712930572\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900760/extras/5ed43888c1d14e189e77c3eb22bb0107.webm?t=1712930572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900760/extras/5ed43888c1d14e189e77c3eb22bb0107.mp4?t=1712930572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u2b9e 100 Levels<br>\u2b9e 100 Achievements<br>\u2b9e Cute Pixel-Art<br>\u2b9e Relaxing music",
